sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant W as Windows 11 Host
    participant P as Podman Desktop
    participant D as dev-box-vscode<br>(Canonical Workstation)
    participant IP as Inner Podman
    participant J as java-dev<br>(Dev Container)
    participant N as dotnet-dev<br>(Dev Container)
    participant A as ai-sandbox-dev<br>(Dev Container)
    participant M as Model Containers<br>(ollama / lmstudio / openai-compatible)

    %% Startup
    W->>P: Launch Podman Desktop
    P->>D: Start dev-box-vscode container
    D->>W: Expose VS Code Server (SSH / Browser)

    %% Developer connects
    W->>D: Developer connects via VS Code

    %% Inner Podman initialization
    D->>IP: Initialize inner Podman engine

    %% Project workflow
    W->>D: Open project folder in VS Code
    D->>IP: Request matching Dev Container
    IP->>J: Start java-dev (if Java project)
    IP->>N: Start dotnet-dev (if .NET project)

    %% AI Sandbox workflow
    W->>D: Open AI Sandbox folder
    D->>IP: Request ai-sandbox-dev
    IP->>A: Start ai-sandbox-dev

    %% Model container orchestration
    A->>IP: Start model containers
    IP->>M: Launch ollama / lmstudio / openai-compatible servers

    %% Usage
    A->>M: Query model APIs
    J->>M: (Optional) Access model APIs
    N->>M: (Optional) Access model APIs

    %% Shutdown
    W->>P: Stop dev-box-vscode
    P->>IP: Stop inner Podman containers
    IP->>M: Stop model containers
